  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your furious destructive rage brings you vigor.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Destroyer’s Blessing<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can regain only one round of rage per round, but you can heal damage every time you cause an object to gain the broken condition. If you destroy an object with a sunder maneuver, you heal 1d4+1 hit points, or you may forfeit this healing to end the fatigued condition, reduce exhaustion to fatigue, or heal 1 point of ability damage.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc78\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
